Start
Create 3x3 board
while game != over
    display board
    ask player to input x:
       if place empty: put x 
       else: display "move elsewhere"
   after player computer moves 
   if row or column or diagonal = X:
       display "Player wins"
   else if row or column or diagonal = 0:
        display "Computer wins"
   else:
        display "draw"
Stop
